}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",\"/categories/ai\",{\"href\":\"/categories/ai\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-6 items-center rounded-[7px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--page)] px-2.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--fg-2)] transition-colors hover:text-[var(--fg)]\",\"children\":\"AI\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[var(--fg-3)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"org-status-dot h-[7px] w-[7px] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--good)]\"}],\"$L3a\"]}]]}],false,false,\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\"]}]}]]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3d:I[21904,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/08l2-y--g5j_-.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3y0aci4c0to7w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3cw3a7soouqxg.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3h863wnh_8rwa.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1mux3zc2rtt2w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0n2nau4l44cce.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1xesy8on3jsmr.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/282k8rssaywac.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/18_suwf0kkza_.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ubog1upkyb_r.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0lyankax-nx3_.js\"],\"OrgReleaseList\"]\n42:I[6942,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/08l2-y--g5j_-.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3y0aci4c0to7w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3cw3a7soouqxg.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3h863wnh_8rwa.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1mux3zc2rtt2w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0n2nau4l44cce.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1xesy8on3jsmr.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/282k8rssaywac.js\"],\"ReportIssue\"]\n43:I[77377,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/08l2-y--g5j_-.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3y0aci4c0to7w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3cw3a7soouqxg.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3h863wnh_8rwa.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1mux3zc2rtt2w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0n2nau4l44cce.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1xesy8on3jsmr.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/282k8rssaywac.js\"],\"OwnDomainLink\"]\n3e:T7fd,## Decision models\r\n\r\nOllama now supports decision models through `/v1/systemone`, based on [TypeSafe’s Jev API](https://typesafe.ai).\r\n\r\nDecision models return choices, probabilities, and scores instead of text. Use them for tasks such as ticket triage, model routing, and content classification.\r\n\r\nAvailable models:\r\n- [**Nimble**](https://ollama.com/library/nimble) from Bespoke Labs\r\n- [**Tev1**](https://ollama.com/library/tev1) from Together AI\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nollama pull nimble\r\n```\r\n\r\nSend context and one or more questions:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\ncurl http://localhost:11434/v1/systemone \\\r\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\r\n  -d '{\r\n    \"model\": \"nimble\",\r\n    \"state\": \"Our checkout has returned 500 errors since 9am.\",\r\n    \"questions\": {\r\n      \"label\": {\r\n        \"type\": \"choice\",\r\n        \"instructions\": \"Which label fits this ticket?\",\r\n        \"criteria\": {\r\n          \"billing\": \"Payments and refunds\",\r\n          \"bug\": \"Software errors\",\r\n          \"account\": \"Login and account access\"\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }'\r\n```\r\n\r\nExample response:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"model\": \"nimble\",\r\n  \"answers\": {\r\n    \"label\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"choice\",\r\n      \"choice\": \"bug\",\r\n      \"probabilities\": {\r\n        \"billing\": 0.0125,\r\n        \"bug\": 0.9781,\r\n        \"account\": 0.0093\r\n      },\r\n      \"confidence\": 0.8906\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"usage\": {\r\n    \"input_tokens\": 174,\r\n    \"output_tokens\": 1\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe API supports three question types:\r\n- `choice`: Select an option and return probabilities for each.\r\n- `noul`: Return the probability that a condition is true.\r\n- `score`: Return a score across an ordered set of criteria\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n- Settings now opens without waiting for model discovery.\r\n- Fixed the macOS update menu and icon not reflecting an available update at startup.\r\n- Fixed stalled MLX model downloads hanging indefinitely.\r\n- Requests containing the deprecated `typical_p` parameter now log a warning instead of failing.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog:** https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.4...v0.35.03f:T83c,\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eGET /api/show\u003c/code\u003e now advertises each model's thinking controls and default:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-sh\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"\u003ecurl\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e http://localhost:11434/api/show\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"\u003e -d\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e '{\"model\": \"glm-5.3-flash:cloud\"}'\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-json\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\"\u003e  \"thinking\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e: {\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\"\u003e    \"values\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e: [\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"low\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"high\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"max\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e],\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\"\u003e    \"default\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"max\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FF938A;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"\u003e…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e40:T83c,\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eGET /api/show\u003c/code\u003e now advertises each model's thinking controls and default:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-sh\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"\u003ecurl\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e http://localhost:11434/api/show\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"\u003e -d\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e '{\"model\": \"glm-5.3-flash:cloud\"}'\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-json\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\"\u003e  \"thinking\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e: {\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\"\u003e    \"values\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e: [\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"low\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"high\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"max\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e],\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\"\u003e    \"default\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"\u003e: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"\u003e\"max\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FF938A;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"\u003e…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e31:[\"$\",\"$L3d\",null,{\"orgSlug\":\"ollama\",\"initialReleases\":[{\"id\":\"rel_MCCuYJULyY6z1EzA2Yhy8\",\"version\":\"v0.35.1-rc0\",\"title\":\"v0.35.1\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* feat: allow ten web searches per response by @ParthSareen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18602\\r\\n* MLX: version bump by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18651\\r\\n* llama.cpp: version bump b11232 by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18652\\r\\n* create: support explicit model capabilities by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18708\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.35.0...v0.35.1-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-29T20:14:22.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-29T23:17:57.994Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.1-rc0\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003efeat: allow ten web searches per response by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ParthSareen\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@ParthSareen\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18602\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18602\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eMLX: version bump by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/dhiltgen\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@dhiltgen\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18651\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18651\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003ellama.cpp: version bump b11232 by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/dhiltgen\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@dhiltgen\u003c/a\u003e in…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_1zgVUKH-4q2hQmpuso_H1\",\"version\":\"v0.35.0-rc1\",\"title\":\"v0.35.0\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* app: sync macOS update menu and icon at startup by @hoyyeva in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18622\\r\\n* app: defer Settings model discovery by @ParthSareen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18598\\r\\n* app: isolate cloud-setting tests from Windows user config by @drifkin in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18626\\r\\n* api: deprecate typical_p by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18627\\r\\n* bench: use HumanEval patch prompts by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/17480\\r\\n* feat: add System One scoring API by @ParthSareen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18606\\r\\n* mlx: bound pull stall retries and let the watchdog interrupt them by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18625\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.4...v0.35.0-rc1\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-28T21:23:22.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-28T22:52:04.501Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.0-rc1\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp: sync macOS update menu and icon at startup by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/hoyyeva\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@hoyyeva\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18622\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18622\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp: defer Settings model discovery by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ParthSareen\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@ParthSareen\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18598\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18598\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp: isolate cloud-setting tests from Windows…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_1FeqEtDGdoF6c6uj43MOy\",\"version\":\"v0.35.0\",\"title\":\"v0.35.0\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"$3e\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-28T21:23:22.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-29T02:56:22.829Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.0\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eDecision models\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eOllama now supports decision models through \u003ccode\u003e/v1/systemone\u003c/code\u003e, based on \u003ca href=\\\"https://typesafe.ai\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eTypeSafe’s Jev API\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eDecision models return choices, probabilities, and scores instead of text. Use them for tasks such as ticket triage, model routing, and…\u003c/p\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_JWcgQ5Tc63RdL1_bIHEB3\",\"version\":\"v0.40.0-rc0\",\"title\":\"v0.40.0\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n**Models run on MLX on Apple Silicon by default**\\r\\n\\r\\nIn this release, model architectures supported by the MLX runner will run by default on Apple Silicon devices.\\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\nollama pull qwen3.8\\r\\nollama run qwen3.8\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring the RC we will be testing and enabling additional models.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.4...v0.40.0-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-25T03:31:52.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-25T05:17:14.513Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.0-rc0\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModels run on MLX on Apple Silicon by default\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eIn this release, model architectures supported by the MLX runner will run by default on Apple Silicon devices.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cpre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\\\"language-plaintext\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"line\\\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eollama pull qwen3.8\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\\n\u003cspan class=\\\"line\\\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eollama run qwen3.8\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eDuring the RC we will be testing and…\u003c/p\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_sGFrNAO1shQsxGWBPCEuR\",\"version\":\"v0.34.4\",\"title\":\"v0.34.4\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n- Structured outputs on thinking models now apply in a single pass, making them faster and more reliable.\\r\\n- Fixed intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors with a large local library\\r\\n- Fixed the macOS app becoming unresponsive when checking if ChatGPT or Codex is running.\\r\\n- Qwen 3.8 prompt processing is faster on Apple Silicon.\\r\\n- Gemma 4 on Apple Silicon now picks the best image resolution per image, keeping more detail in high-resolution images.\\r\\n- Updated llama.cpp, MLX, and XGrammar.\\r\\n \\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.3...v0.34.4\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-23T02:24:43.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-24T04:51:20.955Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.4\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":false,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eStructured outputs on thinking models now apply in a single pass, making them faster and more reliable.\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eFixed intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors with a large local library\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eFixed the macOS app becoming unresponsive when checking if ChatGPT or Codex…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_dcMw5jIfERvyEGtktTsZf\",\"version\":\"v0.34.4-rc1\",\"title\":\"v0.34.4\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* server: fix intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors. by @rick-github in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18438\\r\\n* server: apply structured outputs in a single pass on thinking models by @jessegross in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18479\\r\\n* app: avoid System Events for ChatGPT/Codex detection by @hoyyeva in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18601\\r\\n* llama.cpp: version update by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18577\\r\\n* MLX: version bump by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18576\\r\\n* mlx: select Gemma 4 image resolution dynamically by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18603\\r\\n* mlx: speed up Qwen 3.8 prompt processing by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18550\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.3...v0.34.4-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-23T02:24:43.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-24T00:47:02.164Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.4-rc1\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eserver: fix intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors. by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/rick-github\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@rick-github\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18438\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18438\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eserver: apply structured outputs in a single pass on thinking models by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/jessegross\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@jessegross\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18479\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18479\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp:…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_AwMM9hBTXo08zhQxczn2H\",\"version\":\"v0.34.4-rc0\",\"title\":\"v0.34.4\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* server: fix intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors. by @rick-github in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18438\\r\\n* server: apply structured outputs in a single pass on thinking models by @jessegross in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18479\\r\\n* app: avoid System Events for ChatGPT/Codex detection by @hoyyeva in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18601\\r\\n* llama.cpp: version update by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18577\\r\\n* MLX: version bump by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18576\\r\\n* mlx: select Gemma 4 image resolution dynamically by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18603\\r\\n* mlx: speed up Qwen 3.8 prompt processing by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18550\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.3...v0.34.4-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-23T02:24:43.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-23T04:25:25.586Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.4-rc0\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eserver: fix intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors. by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/rick-github\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@rick-github\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18438\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18438\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eserver: apply structured outputs in a single pass on thinking models by \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/jessegross\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003e@jessegross\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18479\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18479\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp:…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_sKcGe6thUK5WIeuTuKuBa\",\"version\":\"v0.34.3\",\"title\":\"v0.34.3\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n`GET /api/show` now advertises each model's thinking controls and default:\\r\\n```sh \\r\\ncurl http://localhost:11434/api/show -d '{\\\"model\\\": \\\"glm-5.3-flash:cloud\\\"}'\\r\\n```\\r\\n```json\\r\\n{\\r\\n  \\\"thinking\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"values\\\": [\\\"low\\\", \\\"high\\\", \\\"max\\\"],\\r\\n    \\\"default\\\": \\\"max\\\"\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n```\\r\\n* **Nemotron H** vision models are now supported on Apple Silicon with MLX\\r\\n* Ollama's macOS app will now no longer reopen windows you've closed when activating it\\r\\n* Fix for model pulls from HuggingFace\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.2...v0.34.3-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-19T00:02:57.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-22T20:16:47.645Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.3\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"$3f\"},{\"id\":\"rel__3QKqLvWM4uede_LmXZie\",\"version\":\"v0.34.3-rc1\",\"title\":\"v0.34.3\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n`GET /api/show` now advertises each model's thinking controls and default:\\r\\n```sh \\r\\ncurl http://localhost:11434/api/show -d '{\\\"model\\\": \\\"glm-5.3-flash:cloud\\\"}'\\r\\n```\\r\\n```json\\r\\n{\\r\\n  \\\"thinking\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"values\\\": [\\\"low\\\", \\\"high\\\", \\\"max\\\"],\\r\\n    \\\"default\\\": \\\"max\\\"\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n```\\r\\n* **Nemotron H** vision models are now supported on Apple Silicon with MLX\\r\\n* Ollama's macOS app will now no longer reopen windows you've closed when activating it\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.2...v0.34.3-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-19T00:02:57.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-19T02:41:52.337Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.3-rc1\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"$40\"},{\"id\":\"rel_t5zwkY1n7OSp-mKKY01ZV\",\"version\":\"v0.34.2-rc0\",\"title\":\"v0.34.2\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* llama.cpp updates\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-15T21:21:07.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-16T01:24:12.709Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.2-rc0\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003ellama.cpp updates\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Changelog\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_cB5sCsGO91VSNJko4nBTt\",\"version\":\"v0.34.2-rc1\",\"title\":\"v0.34.2\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* llama.cpp updates\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-15T21:21:07.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-16T21:45:48.922Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.2-rc1\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003ellama.cpp updates\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Changelog\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_MmsNbq9JeDFIkG3wPbZ2J\",\"version\":\"v0.34.2\",\"title\":\"v0.34.2\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n- Added first-run setup when running `ollama`, with options to sign in or continue locally. Setup completion is shared with the desktop app on macOS and Windows.\\r\\n- Added `ollama://apps` to open the desktop app’s Apps page directly on macOS and Windows.\\r\\n- Fixed excessive memory growth during long generations with MLX speculative decoding.\\r\\n- Updated llama.cpp.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-15T21:21:07.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-17T22:11:42.040Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.2\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eAdded first-run setup when running \u003ccode\u003eollama\u003c/code\u003e, with options to sign in or continue locally. Setup completion is shared with the desktop app on macOS and Windows.\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eAdded \u003ccode\u003eollama://apps\u003c/code\u003e to open the desktop app’s Apps page directly on macOS and Windows.\\r\\n-…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_EH9exp8WGOjDPPWT1ep2B\",\"version\":\"v0.34.2-rc2\",\"title\":\"v0.34.2\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* llama.cpp updates\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-15T21:21:07.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-17T18:07:24.504Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.2-rc2\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003ellama.cpp updates\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Changelog\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ehttps://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.1...v0.34.2-rc0\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_vGnO915C8sC-szRg3xsN1\",\"version\":\"v0.34.1-rc1\",\"title\":\"v0.34.1\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* app: fix ChatGPT model selector spacing\\r\\n* mlxrunner: Evict prefix cache snapshots from the active conversation\\r\\n* mlxrunner: check system free memory and wait for evicted runners before loading the next MLX model \\r\\n* llm: raise token repeat limit to 100 and return error instead of incomplete result\\r\\n* mlx: scope array lifetimes instead of pinning and sweeping\\r\\n* llm: keep gemma3n projector off the CPU\\r\\n* app: refresh Apps layout and command copy feedback\\r\\n* MLX and llama.cpp updates\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.0...v0.34.1-rc1\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-14T22:14:03.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-15T00:58:21.911Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.1-rc1\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp: fix ChatGPT model selector spacing\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003emlxrunner: Evict prefix cache snapshots from the active conversation\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003emlxrunner: check system free memory and wait for evicted runners before loading the next MLX model\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003ellm: raise token repeat limit to 100 and…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_eOp3o5ieR0vFN8j07zuvm\",\"version\":\"v0.34.1\",\"title\":\"v0.34.1\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* MLX safetensors `ollama create` no longer experimental.  GGUF model creation now requires using llama.cpp tooling for safetensor conversion and quantization.\\r\\n* Improved MLX memory handling on Apple Silicon\\r\\n* Runaway repeat token detection now requires 100 repeat tokens for reduced false positives (e.g. OCR)\\r\\n* `/api/tags` is much faster on large model libraries (3.1 s → 294 ms cold in testing), and model capabilities are now reported consistently.\\r\\n* Deprecated `typical_p`: it can no longer be set when creating new models, existing GGUF models retain support.\\r\\n* MLX and llama.cpp updates\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.0...v0.34.1-rc1\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-14T22:14:03.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-15T21:19:54.151Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.1\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":false,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eMLX safetensors \u003ccode\u003eollama create\u003c/code\u003e no longer experimental.  GGUF model creation now requires using llama.cpp tooling for safetensor conversion and quantization.\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eImproved MLX memory handling on Apple Silicon\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eRunaway repeat token detection now requires 100…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_E-6QlctIWTc04HI34W9T8\",\"version\":\"v0.34.1-rc2\",\"title\":\"v0.34.1\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* app: fix ChatGPT model selector spacing\\r\\n* mlxrunner: Evict prefix cache snapshots from the active conversation\\r\\n* mlxrunner: check system free memory and wait for evicted runners before loading the next MLX model \\r\\n* llm: raise token repeat limit to 100 and return error instead of incomplete result\\r\\n* mlx: scope array lifetimes instead of pinning and sweeping\\r\\n* llm: keep gemma3n projector off the CPU\\r\\n* app: refresh Apps layout and command copy feedback\\r\\n* MLX and llama.cpp updates\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.0...v0.34.1-rc1\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-14T22:14:03.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-15T09:06:58.682Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.1-rc2\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eWhat's Changed\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eapp: fix ChatGPT model selector spacing\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003emlxrunner: Evict prefix cache snapshots from the active conversation\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003emlxrunner: check system free memory and wait for evicted runners before loading the next MLX model\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003ellm: raise token repeat limit to 100 and…\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_wJhHZU_hQfcmUiZ-03Fr0\",\"version\":\"v0.34.0-rc5\",\"title\":\"v0.34.0\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## Use Ollama models in ChatGPT Desktop\\r\\n\\r\\nOllama models can now be used directly in ChatGPT Desktop, so you can keep your existing workflow while running open models. Setup is available from the Ollama app on MacOS.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis release also improves structured output performance on Apple Silicon, adds support for OpenAI-compatible client tool search and response compaction, and makes images work correctly through compacted responses.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.33.3...v0.34.0-rc5\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-05T23:49:00.000Z\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-09-09T22:48:55.389Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.0-rc5\",\"media\":[],\"type\":\"feature\",\"prerelease\":true,\"titleGenerated\":null,\"titleShort\":null,\"breaking\":\"unknown\",\"importance\":\"$undefined\",\"composition\":\"$undefined\",\"source\":{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"type\":\"github\",\"appStore\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"},\"product\":null,\"bodyHtml\":\"\u003ch4\u003eUse Ollama models in ChatGPT Desktop\u003c/h4\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eOllama models can now be used directly in ChatGPT Desktop, so you can keep your existing workflow while running open models. Setup is available from the Ollama app on MacOS.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eThis release also improves structured output performance on…\u003c/p\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"rel_qoSNDqUf-UafYqokA5TCb\",\"version\":\"v0.34.0-rc1\",\"title\":\"v0.34.0\",\"summary\":\"\",\"content\":\"## Use Ollama models in ChatGPT Desktop\\r\\n\\r\\nOllama models can now be used directly in ChatGPT Desktop, so you can keep your existing workflow while running open models. Setup is available from the Ollama app on MacOS.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis release also improves structured output performance on Apple Silicon, adds support for OpenAI-compatible client tool search and response compaction, and makes images work correctly through compacted responses.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.33.3...v0.34.0-rc1\",\"pu